-- Six new comprehension passages, 30 questions. Every question was judged
-- by three independent hostile reviewers (a test-taker's advocate arguing for
-- wrong answers, a non-native-fairness reviewer, a psychometrician), with
-- flagged items repaired and re-judged; the batch was then re-reviewed by hand
-- before this insert. This bank replaces a single passage that was hardcoded
-- in the client bundle and served to everyone forever. One passage is dealt
-- per attempt, so a leaked key now covers 1/7 of comprehension, not all of it.
do $$
declare v_p uuid;
begin

Hi Morgan,

Starting next month, our team meets with the auditors every Tuesday morning, so I can no longer make our usual 9:00 a.m. call. Could we shift it to Thursdays at 2:00 p.m. instead? Before you confirm, please check the shared calendar — I noticed two client bookings are already in that slot for the first two Thursdays. If those can''t be moved, offer me another afternoon and I''ll work around it. Once we settle on a time, please update the recurring invite through the end of the year.

Thanks,
Alex') returning id into v_p;

Hi Dana,

Quick update. The client has moved our review meeting from Friday to Wednesday morning, so I need the summary document earlier than we planned. Could you pull together the key points from the March and April reports — decisions made, open questions, and next steps — into a single two-page summary? Please send me a draft by Tuesday at noon so I have time to look it over before the meeting. If any figures are missing from the reports, flag them rather than leaving blanks. Thanks for turning this around quickly.

Best,
Morgan') returning id into v_p;

Hi Alex,

Daniel joins the team on Monday, and most of his setup is finished. His email account and calendar are active, and he has signed the employment contract. Two things are still open: he cannot access the shared drive yet, and we have not received his signed confidentiality agreement. The drive access is waiting on IT because our request was sent to the old support address. Could you resend it to the new one today? Once both items are done, I will add Daniel to the client folders so he can start real work.

Thanks,
Mira') returning id into v_p;
end $$;
